title: April Conference of the <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span>
subtitle: The new leadership seeks a merger with leftist elements hostile to the Communist Party...
view-if: stegerwald_skibidi_time == time and (z_leader == "Stegerwald" or z_leader == "Adenauer") and dnvp_ideology == "Radical" and not kvp_cnblp_sister and not dkp_merger_waiting
new-page: true
max-visits: 1
tags: event
face-image: img/zentrum_3.jpg

 April Conference of the <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span>

 The <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span> is a pan socialist party, there is no denying that.

With the recent shakeups in leftist politics caused by the establishment of the <span style="color: #AD1818;">**Communist Party**</span>, the dynamaism of the <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span> finds itself in question.

To remedy this, a merger has been proposed between the <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span> and <span style="color: #00963B;">**GAY**</span> to unite their parties to stand against the newly formed menance on the left.

A vote has been put up to settle this matter once and for all.



- @cvp_kvp_merger: The <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span> absorbs the <span style="color: #00963B;">**GAY**</span>!
- @status_quo: The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] has rejected a merger with the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> splinters.

@cvp_kvp_merger
subtitle: The leadership of the <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span> desires the boost the merger with <span style="color: #00963B;">**GAY**</span> will provide. They do not care about the opinions of the <span style="color: #AD1818;">**Communist Party**</span>
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color: #A60A3D;">**RSWP**</span> unexpectedly shoots down the merger! They clearly care more about their relations with the <span style="color: #AD1818;">**Communist Party**</span> too much
choose-if: z_relation < 40 and not ((in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front or (spd_prussia and not in_left_front_prussia and not in_spd_majority_prussia)))
on-arrival: z_party_name = "CVP"; workers_z -= 3; workers_spd += 3; unemployed_z -= 3; unemployed_spd += 3
face-image: img/cvp.jpg
go-to: cvp_kvp_formed if kvp_formed; cvp_kvp_lite_formed if not kvp_formed

The [? if z_leader == "Stegerwald": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_leader == "Adenauer": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] has officially absorbed the much smaller <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>, expanding its reach to the right. Unsurprisingly, this has severely strained relations between our two parties, as former <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span> figures like Westarp remain openly hostile to any cooperation with the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>.

Still, the party’s transformation marches on. [? if z_leader == "Stegerwald": To mark the merger—and its progress toward becoming an interconfessional Volkspartei—it has formally rebranded itself as the <i>Christliche Volkspartei</i> (<span style="color: #000000;">Christian People's Party</span>)—an effort to finally shed its old, Catholic-associated <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span> label. ?]

@status_quo
subtitle: [? if in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front or (spd_prussia and not in_left_front_prussia and not in_spd_majority_prussia): The [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] is currently in a coalition with us, and don't want to endanger its stability.?] [? if z_relation >= 40 and not (in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front or (spd_prussia and not in_left_front_prussia and not in_spd_majority_prussia)): Significant portions of the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] supporting maintaining our relationship, and don't want to potentially endanger it. ?]
choose-if: z_relation >= 40 or (in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front or (spd_prussia and not in_left_front_prussia and not in_spd_majority_prussia))
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not (in_weimar_coalition or in_grand_coalition or in_popular_front or (spd_prussia and not in_left_front_prussia and not in_spd_majority_prussia)): We are not in any government with the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?], leaving them free to do what they want. ?] [? if z_relation < 40 : Our relations are too low for them to care about what we think. ?]
on-arrival: z_relation += 10; z_party_name = "CVP"; pro_republic += 5; nationalism -= 3; rural_kvp -= 2; rural_other -= 2 if not kvp_formed; rural_z += 2
face-image: img/zentrum_2.jpg

The status quo prevails. The [? if z_leader == "Stegerwald": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_leader == "Adenauer": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?] and the <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span> will remain separate—at least for now. Perhaps this is proof enough that the party still values cooperation with us over chasing after every fragment of the old Right.

Even so, the party’s transformation presses on. [? if z_leader == "Stegerwald": To cement its evolution into an interconfessional *Volkspartei*, it has formally rebranded itself as the <i>Christliche Volkspartei</i> (<span style="color: #000000;">Christian People's Party</span>)—a move to finally shed its old, Catholic-associated <span style="color: #000000;">Center</span> label. ?]

